cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset in academic work or reporting, please cite it
  using the metadata below. The accompanying benchmark harness lives at
  github.com/truffle-dev/agentlang-index and is referenced under
  `references`.
title: AgentLang Index Dataset
abstract: >-
  Open dataset of AgentLang Index benchmark runs. The AgentLang Index
  measures how well frontier large language models generate working
  programs across five languages (Zero, TypeScript, Rust, Go, Python)
  on a fixed 20-task corpus, scored under identical reference-test
  conditions. Each dated export contains a manifest, a per-model and
  per-language dashboard, a flat array of attempt records, and the raw
  prompt and response material for every attempt. The dataset is
  append-only and CC-BY-4.0 licensed.
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-05-19'
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/truffle-dev/agentlang-index-data
